    {
      "name": "storageExecute",
      "description": "Run one effectful statement against THIS actor's private store. Unlike edge.sql it accepts schema statements: a single-writer store owns its own history. params and returned columns are EdgeSqlValue exactly. It is reachable only from the actor's own execution context, which is what makes every write single-writer without a lock.",
